# Copy to `.env` and adjust for your environment.
#
# The app talks to TNL's own standalone API server in `server/`. Point this at
# a reachable host:
#
#   - Android emulator uses http://10.0.2.2:3000 automatically (host loopback).
#   - iOS simulator can use http://localhost:3000.
#   - Physical devices / BlueStacks need the HTTPS tunnel URL from `npm run
#     tunnel`, or a deployed URL once the server is live.
#
# Currently using the live tunnel from `npm run tunnel` (proxies to the local
# server on :3000). A quick tunnel gets a NEW URL on every restart, so update
# this after each `npm run tunnel`.
#
# Note: Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables at build time, so restart
# `expo start` with `--clear` after changing this file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3000
